46.61875198754436,9.180333833097048,1251],[46.618894683100315,9.180416783438268,1251]]]},"properties":{"land":"mountainbike","category":"local","language":"en","start":"Vals","end":"Vals","via":null,"abstract":"A shorter tour on the sunny side of the Vals valley. The varied route offers beautiful views, diverse opportunities for rest and refreshments, and benches to sit down and gaze at the beautiful Vals mountains. The path also takes you past some interesting chapels and churches.","foto":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_4_s.jpg","foto_urls":null,"foto_master":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-master/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_4_M.jpg","foto_big":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-big/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_4_g.jpg","foto_standard":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_4_s.jpg","foto_small":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-small/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_4_k.jpg","foto_abstract":null,"logo":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_233_RF_Leis_140px.jpg","logo_svg":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-svg/ML_233_Leis.svg","x_coordinate":732872.1278835955,"y_coordinate":164396.57392958304,"description":"From the starting point of Vals Post Office through the village of Vals to the valley station of the Vals cable car. From there take the gondola to the mountain station in the direction of «Gadastatt». The descent starts at the summit station of the Vals cable car. A steep descent with up to 25% gradient on the first section to «Büdemlihus» hut. On firm surfaces to »Upper Büni» with the beautiful «Gannitobel» waterfall. The trail continues to «Güngelbord», and on to Leis (a fine opportunity to rest and eat at Restaurant Ganni), then further on to «Zorts», «Soladüra», «Wolfazu» and «Camp». The tour winds down pleasantly to its end on the way back through the valley bottom to Vals Post Office/ valley station.\n\nVarious sites such as the «Büdemlihus» hut, the «Gannitobel» with its impressive waterfall, and the chapels and churches make this route a real pleasure.","length":10,"length_asphalt":6,"length_unsurfaced":4,"length_singletrail":0,"height_difference":80,"height_difference_back":620,"height_downwards":null,"hiking_time":null,"hiking_time_back":null,"category_grade":"easy","category_grade_text":null,"category_grade_skiing":null,"category_condition":"easy","category_condition_text":null,"cantons":[2],"photo_gallery":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_4_s.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_2.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_3.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_6.jpg"],"photo_gallery_big":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-big/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_4_g.jpg","","",""],"photo_gallery_urls":[null,null,null,null],"photo_gallery_ids":["215974","20681","20682","20684"],"photo_gallery_copyright":["                                                      ","","",""],"photo_gallery_author":["","","",""],"photo_gallery_coords":["","","",""],"photo_gallery_abstract":["","","",""],"photo_favorite":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_4_s.jpg"],"photo_favorite_master":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-master/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_4_M.jpg"],"photo_favorite_big":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-big/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_4_g.jpg"],"photo_favorite_small":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-small/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_4_k.jpg"],"foto_teaser":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_1_T.jpg"],"name":null,"name_2":null,"street":null,"zip":null,"place":null,"tel":null,"email":null,"url1_link":null,"change_date":"2026-05-27 12:23:18","desc_major_change_date":null,"geometry_last_major_change":"2026-05-27 08:29:37","segment_count":0,"bookable_ids":[],"group_ids":[281],"accommodation_ids":[37392],"cycleservice_ids":[],"velorental_ids":[],"group_numbers":[12],"direction_ids":[3743,6703,3744],"arrival_ids":[1003],"detour_ids":[],"goodtoknows":["1003_Arrival","3743_Direction","6703_Direction","3744_Direction"],"type":"routen","title":"Leis","r_number":"233","has_segment":false,"panel_hasnumber":true,"signal_way":"oneway","heightprofile_file":null,"url_de":"https://schweizmobil.ch/de/mountainbike/route-233","url_fr":"https://schweizmobil.ch/fr/mountain-bike/itineraire-233","url_it":"https://schweizmobil.ch/it/mountain-bike/percorso-233","url_en":"https://schweizmobil.ch/en/mountain-biking-in-switzerland/route-233","translations":{"de":{"abstract":"Kürzere Tour auf der Sonnenseite des Valsertals. Der abwechslungsreiche Weg bietet schöne Ausblicke, diverse Einkehrmöglichkeiten und Bänkli zum Verweilen mit schöner Aussicht auf die Valser Bergwelt. Ausserdem führt er an einigen sehenswerten Kapellen und Kirchen vorbei.","description":"Vom Startpunkt Vals Post durch das Dorf Vals zur Talstation Sportbahnen Vals. Von dort mit der Gondelbahn zur Bergstation nach Gadastatt. Die Talfahrt beginnt bei der Bergstation der Sportbahnen Vals. Steile Abfahrt mit bis zu 25 % Gefälle auf dem ersten Teilstück bis Büdemlihus. Auf fester Fahrbahn nach Ober Büni mit dem schönen Wasserfall Gannitobel. Der Weg führt weiter zum Güngelbord, nach Leis (schöne Einkehrmöglichkeit im Restaurant Ganni), weiter nach Zorts, Soladüra, Wolfazu und Camp. Die Tour klingt gemütlich aus auf der Rückfahrt im Talboden nach Vals Post / Talstation.\n\nDiverse Sehenswürdigkeiten wie das Büdemlihus, das Gannitobel mit beeindruckendem Wasserfall und die Kapellen und Kirchen machen diese Strecke zum Genuss."},"fr":{"abstract":"Itinéraire sur l'adret de la vallée de Vals. Ce chemin très diversifié offre de belles perspectives, diverses possibilités de ravitaillement ainsi que des bancs permettant de profiter de vues magnifiques de l'univers montagnard de Vals. En outre, il est ponctué de chapelles et d'églises remarquables.","description":"La randonnée démarre à la poste de Vals. L'itinéraire franchit le village pour rejoindre la station inférieure des remontées mécanique de Vals. La télécabine permet d'accéder à la station supérieure de Gadastatt. La descente débute à la station supérieure des remontées mécaniques de Vals. Descente en pente escarpée avec pentes jusqu'à 25 % lors de la première étape jusqu'à Büdemlihus. Une chaussée rigide conduit à Ober Büni avec la splendide cascade de Gannitobel. Le chemin continue vers Güngelbord, Leis (excellente possibilité de ravitaillement au restaurant Ganni), Zorts, Soladüra, Wolfazu et Camp. Le circuit se termine sur une note décontractée avec le trajet retour vers Vals Post / station inférieure au fond de la vallée.\n\nDiverses attractions telles que le Büdemlihus, le Gannitobel et son impressionnante cascade ainsi que des églises et des chapelles font de cet itinéraire une véritable partie de plaisir."},"it":{"abstract":"Escursione più breve sul lato esposto al sole della valle di Vals. Il percorso variato offre bei panorami, varie possibilità di ristoro e panchine per riposare e ammirare la bellissima veduta sulle montagne di Vals. Inoltre tocca alcune cappelle e chiese che vale la pena visitare.","description":"Dal punto di partenza Vals Posta si attraversa il villaggio fino alla stazione a valle degli impianti di risalita Vals. Da lì si sale in cabinovia alla stazione a monte e si arriva a Gadastatt. La discesa inizia presso la stazione a monte dei detti impianti. Discesa ripida con pendenze fino al 25% sul primo tratto fino a Büdemlihus. Su pista compatta si continua verso Ober Büni, dove si può ammirare la bella cascata Gannitobel. La strada porta poi al Güngelbord, a Leis (possibilità di ristoro nel ristorante Ganni), poi a Zorts, Soladüra, Wolfazu e Camp. La gita termina in modo tranquillo con il viaggio di ritorno al fondovalle a Vals Posta / stazione a valle.\n\nVarie attrazioni come il Büdemlihus, il Gannitobel con l'impressionante cascata, le cappelle e le chiese fanno di questa escursione un vero piacere."}}}}